      <msdyn_content>&lt;pphml&gt;&lt;h1&gt;How to add and manage a campaign&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;Contest Campaigns are used to declare the event and its paraments&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The &lt;coachmark target="[data-id=&amp;quot;andy_starttime&amp;quot;]"&gt;Start Tim&lt;/coachmark&gt;e and &lt;coachmark target="[data-id=&amp;quot;andy_endtime&amp;quot;]"&gt;End Time&lt;/coachmark&gt; are used to set the overall event date and time&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The &lt;coachmark target="[data-id=&amp;quot;andy_maxentriespercontact&amp;quot;]"&gt;Max Entries Per Contact&lt;/coachmark&gt; set the max for how many entries each contact can have during the event. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The &lt;coachmark target="[data-id=&amp;quot;andy_checkincodeprefix&amp;quot;]"&gt;Check-In Code Prefix &lt;/coachmark&gt;is set automaticity when the record is set&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/pphml&gt;</msdyn_content>
